{"articleNo":"2288","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2288&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 2학기 수강지도상담 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.28","hit":"25904","attachments":[{"name":"수강지도상담방법1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2288&attachNo=1669"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009학년도 2학기 수강지도상담 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2009학년도 2학기부터 시행하는 “수강지도상담”을 아래와 같이 안내하오니,&nbsp;<br>해당 학생들은 수강지도기간에 지도교수와 상담하여 “수강승인”을 받으시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff00ff\">1. 적용대상 : 재학생에 한하여 실시(2009. 8. 2일자)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000cd\">☞제외자 : 2009학년도 2학기 복학자,휴학자, 2009학년도 2학기 신(편)입생,</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000cd\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 재입학생, 시간제등록생, 타교생</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 수강지도상담 기간 : 2009. 8. 3(월) 10:00 ~ 8. 14(금) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 상담내역</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 교과목 이수체계도를 충분히 숙지하여 교육과정 이수에 문제가 발생 하지</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 않도록 하며, 부족한 학습성과 항목을 체크하도록 함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 수강지도상담 방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #0000cc; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">[첨부파일 참고] </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000\">5. 유의사항</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 수강지도 기간 중 지도교수와 상담을 하지 않고 수강승인을 받지 못한</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생은 수강신청기간에 수강신청을 할 수 없음.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 수강신청 페이지 로그인 불가 </span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 수강지도기간에 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 학부 사무실로 문의.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞“6. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내” 참고</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">6. 업무별 문의 전화번호 안내 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt dotted; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"110\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">업무별</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"25\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"279\" colspan=\"2\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">문&nbsp; 의&nbsp; 처</span></p>\n  